WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.546
Telemetry forms the foundation of modern security operations.

00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:06.992
Visibility enables detection, investigation, response, threat hunting, reporting,

00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:08.285
and continuous improvement.

00:00:08.285 --> 00:00:12.592
Useful telemetry comes from many sources, including identities, endpoints, applications,

00:00:12.592 --> 00:00:15.608
networks, cloud services, infrastructure, and security tools.

00:00:15.608 --> 00:00:19.915
Collection should be driven by security questions and business priorities.

00:00:19.915 --> 00:00:25.946
Teams need to know which sources exist, who owns them, what activity they record,

00:00:25.946 --> 00:00:28.100
how long they retain data,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.408
and which gaps could prevent an important detection or investigation.

00:00:32.408 --> 00:00:34.992
Quality matters as much as volume.

00:00:34.992 --> 00:00:37.577
Completeness, accuracy, timeliness, normalization, enrichment, retention,

00:00:37.577 --> 00:00:41.885
and coverage determine whether analysts can rely on the data.

00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:47.915
Monitoring source health and testing expected events help keep visibility dependable as systems change.

00:00:47.915 --> 00:00:54.377
Organizations that understand and continuously refine their telemetry are better positioned to manage cybersecurity risk.

00:00:54.377 --> 00:00:57.392
The goal is not to collect everything.

00:00:57.392 --> 00:01:04.285
The goal is to maintain the evidence needed for informed defensive decisions when those decisions matter.

00:01:04.285 --> 00:01:09.023
A sustainable telemetry program assigns owners, documents purposes, protects sensitive data,

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:14.623
monitors cost and source health, and reviews coverage when technology or risk changes.

00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:19.362
Managers, engineers, analysts, responders, privacy teams, and system owners all contribute.

00:01:19.362 --> 00:01:24.100
Their shared work turns disconnected event streams into dependable operational visibility.
